  m_Name: Dialogue_ForgeKeeperTar
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Voidborne::DialogueTree
  startNodeId: root
  nodes:
  - nodeId: root
    speakerName: ForgeKeeper Tar
    text: "Surface dweller. You're either brave or stupid \u2014 the tunnels sort
      those out quick. I'm Tar. I keep the forges running and the Delve from collapsing.
      What do you want?"
    choices:
    - text: I need refined materials.
      nextNodeId: trade
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
    - text: Can you teach me automation?
      nextNodeId: automation
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
    - text: I proved myself up top. Any work?
      nextNodeId: quest_check
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
    - text: "The Vehicle Workbench \u2014 I need the schematic."
      nextNodeId: workbench
      condition:
        type: 1
        questId: MSQ_04_TheDelve
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
    - text: Farewell.
      nextNodeId: 
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
  - nodeId: trade
    speakerName: ForgeKeeper Tar
    text: Shop's open. Don't touch anything you're not paying for.
    choices:
    - text: Let me see what you have.
      nextNodeId: 
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 3
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
    - text: Back.
      nextNodeId: root
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
  - nodeId: automation
    speakerName: ForgeKeeper Tar
    text: "The belt conveyors, the hoppers, the drill heads \u2014 all mine. Took
      me six years underground to work it out. I'll share what I know once I know
      you won't waste it."
    choices:
    - text: Fair enough. What do you need?
      nextNodeId: quest_check
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
    - text: Back.
      nextNodeId: root
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
  - nodeId: quest_check
    speakerName: ForgeKeeper Tar
    text: "The lower shaft is flooded with VORD drones. I need the blockage cleared
      before we can access the deepest ore seam. Clear it out \u2014 then we'll talk."
    choices:
    - text: I'll handle it.
      nextNodeId: quest_accept
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 4
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: tar_quest_accepted
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
    - text: Not right now.
      nextNodeId: root
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
  - nodeId: quest_accept
    speakerName: ForgeKeeper Tar
    text: "Lower shaft is two levels down, east tunnel. Watch for the crystallised
      gas pockets \u2014 a stray shot sets them off. Come back when it's done."
    choices:
    - text: On it.
      nextNodeId: 
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
      action:
        type: 0
        quest: {fileID: 0}
        giveItem:
          item: {fileID: 0}
          quantity: 0
        worldEventId: 
        schematicItem: {fileID: 0}
  - nodeId: workbench
    speakerName: ForgeKeeper Tar
    text: "You actually cleared that shaft. Didn't think you had it in you.\n\nHere.
      Vehicle Workbench schematic. I designed it myself \u2014 you'll need a decent
      forge to assemble it."
    choices:
    - text: Thank you, Tar.
      nextNodeId: 
      condition:
        type: 0
        questId: 
        item: {fileID: 0}
        cortexModuleIndex: -1
        invert: 0
